@page "/components/subscription-details"

<PageTitle>Subscription Details — Unpoly.Blazor.Shadcn</PageTitle>

<h1 class="doc-h1">Subscription Details</h1>
<p class="doc-lede">
    ui-layouts' "subscription details" pricing section, ported class for class: a Monthly/Annual
    pill, four plan cards with the featured one a black slab under an orange glow, prices that
    roll digit by digit, and a question with its answer underneath.
</p>

<h2 class="doc-h2">As it ships</h2>
<Example Source="SubscriptionDetailsExample.razor" Block><SubscriptionDetailsExample /></Example>

<h2 class="doc-h2">Your own plans</h2>
<p class="doc-note">
    Each plan carries both prices — upstream works the annual one out as 15% off, and the
    defaults are its sums. <code>Question="@@null"</code> leaves the row under the cards out;
    <code>Answer</code> takes any markup.
</p>
